      "level": 2,
      "heading": "Overview",
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "text": "Use Game Center leaderboard set member localizations to specify the specific localizations that a leaderboard displays when referenced as part of a Game Center Leaderboard set. See `POST-v1-gameCenterLeaderboardSetLocalizations` for more information. If you instead want to create a localization for a specific leaderboard, see `POST-v1-gameCenterLeaderboardLocalizations`.",
